          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafilisti wakapigana nao, Israeli wakapigwa, wakakimbia kila mtu hemani kwake; wakauawa watu wengi sana; maana katika Israeli walianguka watu thelathini elfu wenye kwenda vitani kwa miguu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
