        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, mtu mmoja wa Benyamini akapiga mbio kutoka mle jeshini akafika Shilo siku ile ile, hali nguo zake zimeraruliwa, na mavumbi kichwani mwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
