                  "text": "Mwa 35:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata alipokuwa katika kufa, wale wanawake waliohudhuria karibu naye wakamwambia, Usiogope; kwa maana umezaa mtoto mwanamume. Walakini hakujibu, wala hakumtazama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
